ill-to-advance gun-game, with shared TypeScript simulation and authoritative networking architecture.","/research/whatgoodarewords/gungame/","repository-research:tangkwok0104/cat-of-duty","tangkwok0104/cat-of-duty","Three.js/Rapier wave-survival FPS with cat soldiers, weapon upgrades and documented Claude Code build, gameplay-testing and adversarial-QA workflow.","/research/tangkwok0104/cat-of-duty/","repository-research:hnprivv/Forge_FPS","hnprivv/Forge_FPS","A Three.js/Socket.IO browser FPS whose built-in project guide describes solo target practice, four-player rooms, Free for All and Search & Destroy, with weapon and explosive-barrel mechanics. Inspected server source implements rooms and relays gameplay events.","/research/hnprivv/Forge_FPS/","repository-research:DustinVII/the-outlands-game","DustinVII/the-outlands-game","Experimental Vite/Three.js multiplayer movement prototype with Socket.io synchronization and an explicitly unfinished combat/physics roadmap.","/research/DustinVII/the-outlands-game/","repository-research:TheFadGhost/operation-blackline","TheFadGhost/operation-blackline","Procedural Three.js/Node browser FPS for self-hosted 5v5 team deathmatch, with bots, authoritative hit checks, client prediction and synthesized assets.","/research/TheFadGhost/operation-blackline/","repository-research:szefo94/VibeOnDuty","szefo94/VibeOnDuty","Three.js browser FPS with wave modes, training, Search & Destroy, Team Deathmatch, a map editor and documented Colyseus dedicated-server multiplayer.","/research/szefo94/VibeOnDuty/","repository-research:rizdigico/VoidStrike-FPS","rizdigico/VoidStrike-FPS","Single-page Three.js FPS with gun-game, deathmatch, survival and timed modes, five arenas, weapon progression and procedural audio.","/research/rizdigico/VoidStrike-FPS/","repository-research:stobieee-bit/FPScape","stobieee-bit/FPScape","A Three.js first-person RPG source tree with implemented skill-XP and quest-state/reward logic, plus a WebSocket multiplayer clien