y chests and synthesized audio.","/research/StarKnightt/cinder-ops/","repository-research:whitwhoa/open-browser-fps","whitwhoa/open-browser-fps","Historical Three.js/Node.js/Socket.io authoritative-server movement example with multiplayer character synchronization, but no shooting implementation.","/research/whitwhoa/open-browser-fps/","repository-research:vincenzo-afk/NIGHTFALL","vincenzo-afk/NIGHTFALL","TypeScript browser-FPS scaffold documenting hero classes, game modes, movement physics and validated network schemas; core combat and rendering remain unchecked.","/research/vincenzo-afk/NIGHTFALL/","repository-research:StarKnightt/operation-ironhold","StarKnightt/operation-ironhold","Single-HTML browser FPS with a timed hostile-clearance objective, procedural world, weapons and audio, plus a published five-prompt AI build account.","/research/StarKnightt/operation-ironhold/","repository-research:kamalesh404/velocity.io","kamalesh404/velocity.io","Three.js multiplayer FPS using Rapier kinematic movement, GLB map colliders, procedural weapon motion and Socket.io synchronization.","/research/kamalesh404/velocity.io/","repository-research:UstymUkhman/YetAnotherZombieHorror","UstymUkhman/YetAnotherZombieHorror","First- and third-person zombie survival shooter with configurable Ammo.js/BVH physics, aiming, weapon switching and visual-effects settings.","/research/UstymUkhman/YetAnotherZombieHorror/","repository-research:mrdoob/three-doom","mrdoob/three-doom","Three.js port of Doom with the first shareware episode and support for user-supplied Doom or Doom II WAD files.","/research/mrdoob/three-doom/","repository-research:kamalesh404/multiplayer-fps-game","kamalesh404/multiplayer-fps-game","BulletStorm Arena browser FPS with Three.js rendering, Socket.io multiplayer, character movement and documented server-side movement/hit validation.","/research/kamalesh404/multiplayer-fps-game/","repository-research:mrdoob/three-descent","mrdoob/three-descent","Three.js port of Desce