kart-royale/","repository-research:maxscharwath/toonks-game","maxscharwath/toonks-game","Browser tank-combat game using WebRTC host/client networking for playing against friends.","/research/maxscharwath/toonks-game/","repository-research:justjavac/minecraft-web","justjavac/minecraft-web","Browser Minecraft-style game with creative and survival modes; the author attributes development to Kimi K3 and documents third-party media sources.","/research/justjavac/minecraft-web/","repository-research:hexianWeb/Third-Person-MC","hexianWeb/Third-Person-MC","Third-person voxel-style world demo with procedural biomes, character movement, camera collision handling, and an evolving combat system.","/research/hexianWeb/Third-Person-MC/","repository-research:LabyStudio/js-minecraft","LabyStudio/js-minecraft","Minecraft-style learning sandbox implementing voxel terrain, lighting, movement, rendering, UI, and multiplayer protocol features.","/research/LabyStudio/js-minecraft/","repository-research:PrismarineJS/prismarine-web-client","PrismarineJS/prismarine-web-client","Runs a Minecraft client in the browser through a WebSocket-to-TCP proxy, with world rendering, player movement, and block interactions.","/research/PrismarineJS/prismarine-web-client/","repository-research:hyperfy-xyz/hyperfy","hyperfy-xyz/hyperfy","Framework for persistent, self-hosted 3D worlds with in-world editing, JavaScript applications, multiplayer collaboration, physics, and VR support.","/research/hyperfy-xyz/hyperfy/","repository-research:kaetram/kaetram-open","kaetram/kaetram-open","Legacy 2D MMORPG and extensible game code descended from BrowserQuest, with server infrastructure and map tooling.","/research/kaetram/kaetram-open/","repository-research:cedric-h/lab","cedric-h/lab","Small multiplayer 3D RPG combat project with a linked gameplay video and credited programming, model, and animation contributors.","/research/cedric-h/lab/","repository-research:stickyfingies/grove","stickyfingies/grove","Browser 