if/bloodwave-fps-game","imr4n4lif/bloodwave-fps-game","A browser wave-survival shooter with multiple weapons, an open terrain/building scene, zombie behaviors, HUD, and audio hooks.","/research/imr4n4lif/bloodwave-fps-game/","repository-research:Arnie016/flight-simulator-fable5","Arnie016/flight-simulator-fable5","A browser flight-training prototype with missions, telemetry, scoring, replay/debrief workflows, and an optional real-time voice instructor.","/research/Arnie016/flight-simulator-fable5/","repository-research:danyparc/antigravity-evil-eyes","danyparc/antigravity-evil-eyes","A browser survival FPS with neon environments, chasing eyeball enemies, physics-based movement, and projectile combat.","/research/danyparc/antigravity-evil-eyes/","repository-research:gianlucatruda/music-melee","gianlucatruda/music-melee","A parkour FPS built around musical timing and scoring, using spatial synthesis, physics, and browser rendering.","/research/gianlucatruda/music-melee/","repository-research:tensorspace-ai/evolution-arena","tensorspace-ai/evolution-arena","A client-side procedural survival game where mutations change creature form and mechanics across generations, with energy, warmth, predators, and touch controls.","/research/tensorspace-ai/evolution-arena/","repository-research:mohsenheydari/three-fps","mohsenheydari/three-fps","An FPS example with an entity/component architecture, Ammo.js rigid-body controls, root-motion NPC animation, and pathfinding.","/research/mohsenheydari/three-fps/","repository-research:bbs220/project_block_shooter","bbs220/project_block_shooter","A low-poly multiplayer FPS prototype with React Three Fiber, a Node authoritative server, Rapier physics, client prediction, and hitscan combat.","/research/bbs220/project_block_shooter/","repository-research:iamrichmack111/richmack-the-forest","iamrichmack111/richmack-the-forest","A haunted driving-survival game with dynamic enemies, camp missions, world events, vehicle combat, instancing, and object pooling.","/research/iamrichmack111/richmack-the-forest/","repository-research:RealAbdurRehman/decay","RealAbdurRehman/decay","A browser survival shooter with monster waves, pickups, movement-dependent gun accuracy, changing maps, and a minimap.","/research/RealAbdurRehman/decay/","repository-research:serejaris/dust-arena","serejaris/dust-arena","The requested Dust Arena repository remains unavailable. The same owner’s earlier claude-fable monorepo preserves historical source and a dated pointer into the requested repository.","/research/serejaris/dust-arena/","repository-research:BarthPaleologue/CosmosJourneyer","BarthPaleologue/CosmosJourneyer","A Babylon.js space-exploration game with procedural planetary worlds, seamless surface exploration, browser/Electron delivery, and documented unit/E2E tests.","/research/BarthPaleologue/CosmosJourneyer/","repository-research:braedonsaunders/voidstrike","braedonsaunders/voidstrike","A browser RTS documenting worker-based ECS simulation, fixed-step deterministic logic, lockstep WebRTC play, desync diagnostics, and GPU rendering.","/research/braedonsaunders/voidstrike/","repository-research:Braffolk/fable5-world-demo","Braffolk/fable5-world-demo","A seeded procedural open-world renderer with generated terrain, erosion, vegetation, water, atmosphere, and documented screenshot/profiling checks.","/research/Braffolk/fable5-world-demo/","repository-research:reicapivararbx/capyquake","reicapivararbx/capyquake","A Three.js arena shooter with mutant-enemy waves, bosses, progression, an item economy, multiplayer lobbies, and touch controls.","/research/reicapivararbx/capyquake/","repository-research:vkopitsa/browser-shooter","vkopitsa/browser-shooter","A browser FPS combining wave survival, host-authoritative WebRTC multiplayer, a round-based bomb mode, a map editor, and OpenStreetMap-based battlefields.","/research/vkopitsa/browser-shooter/","repository-research:Burry/mark-of-the-veil","Burry/mark-of-the-veil","An eight-chapter browser action campaign with first/third-person switching, arena encounters, bosses, gamepad support, and procedural music.","/research/Burry/mark-of-the-veil/","repository-research:alexdevmotion/grand-theft-austerity-open-world","alexdevmotion/grand-theft-austerity-open-world","A third-person political-satire game with an OpenStreetMap-derived Bucharest, campaign missions, free roam, vehicles, police, weather, and progression.","/research/alexdevmotion/grand-theft-austerity-open-world/","repository-research:Kevin-Liu-01/Claude-of-Tanks","Kevin-Liu-01/Claude-of-Tanks","An armored-combat browser game with plate-level armor, ballistics, destructible battlefields, fixed-step authority, multiplayer, and a scene/vehicle inspection studio.","/research/Kevin-Liu-01/Claude-of-Tanks/","repository-research:corosolto/client","corosolto/client","A Brazilian-satire browser FPS with bot matches, multiplayer beta, procedural and imported assets, and documented visual-evaluation tooling.","/research/corosolto/client/","repository-research:levy-street/world-of-claudecraft","levy-street/world-of-claudecraft","A browser MMO with a shared deterministic game core for an authoritative multiplayer server, an offline world, and a headless Gymnasium environment.","/research/levy-street/world-of-claudecraft/","repository-research:Humpalumps/Cadle","Humpalumps/Cadle","Browser FPS-RPG with data-driven quests, procedural terrain, synthesized audio and separate visual, animation and performance inspection tools.","/research/Humpalumps/Cadle/","foundation:godot-3d-squash","godot-3d-squash","Make a playable 3D character game","Move a character, jump onto enemies, and replay after losing. This complete Godot game teaches interaction and animation in a small 3D arena.","/examples/godot-3d-squash/","foundation:phaser-starshake","phaser-starshake","Take a browser shooter to mobile","Play Starshake, a complete space shooter, then follow the official tutorial to adapt its controls and layout for mobile. This path extends an existing game.","/examples/phaser-starshake/","foundation:godot-2d-dodge","godot-2d-dodge","Your first 2D game","Dodge enemies, survive longer, and restart a complete small game. This official Godot project is a foundation for an AI-assisted workflow.","/examples/godot-2d-dodge/","example:deepseek-mini-ksp","deepseek-mini-ksp","Mini KSP: a Chinese rocket sandbox","Build staged rockets, launch into orbit, unlock technology, and complete missions in a Chinese-language spaceflight sandbox.","/examples/deepseek-mini-ksp/","example:deepseek-neon-snake","deepseek-neon-snake","Snake: Neon Arcade Edition","A neon Snake game with levels, changing speed and grid size, keyboard and touch input, and persistent high scores.","/examples/deepseek-neon-snake/","example:gemini-pumpkin-hunt","gemini-pumpkin-hunt","Midnight Pumpkin Hunt","A first-person forest horror game: light five pumpkins while managing flashlight power, stamina, and a pursuing stalker.","/examples/gemini-pumpkin-hunt/","example:gemini-kymograph","gemini-kymograph","Kymograph","A CRT-styled deduction puzzle: observe a signal, infer its hidden transformation rules, and construct the counter-signal.","/examples/gemini-kymograph/","example:gemini-pirate-fleet","gemini-pirate-fleet","Pirate Fleet Commander","Sail a flagship across a generated sea, fight other ships, and use recovered loot to expand and upgrade a fleet.","/examples/gemini-pirate-fleet/","example:beach-kitty-ai-campaign","beach-kitty-ai-campaign","Beach Kitty","A cat-led Phaser campaign that combines running, platforming, shooting, and other arcade mechanics, with optional generated cat art.","/examples/beach-kitty-ai-campaign/","example:cursor-destruction-derby","cursor-destruction-derby","Destruction Derby Arena","A browser car-combat arena with local two-player controls, computer opponents, collisions, and vehicle damage.","/examples/cursor-destruction-derby/","example:cursor-space-shooter","cursor-space-shooter","Space Shooter: a family Cursor experiment","A complete top-down arcade shooter with enemy waves, health pickups, weapon upgrades, and procedural sound.","/examples/cursor-space-shooter/","example:agent-arcade-copilot","agent-arcade-copilot","Agent Arcade: Copilot builds desktop arcade games","A desktop arcade collection with a platformer and space shooters, wrapped in a transparent cross-platform overlay.","/examples/agent-arcade-copilot/","example:quasar-saz-claude","quasar-saz-claude","Quasar Saz: an unusual Claude Code experiment","A musical arena shooter with six waves, an evolving instrument weapon, procedural visuals, synthesized audio, and a final boss.","/examples/quasar-saz-claude/","example:gravity-birds-grok-cursor","gravity-birds-grok-cursor","Gravity Birds: Grok Bot directs Cursor","A grid-based Godot puzzle where a growing bird collects fruit, falls under gravity, and reaches an exit, with undo and original levels.","/examples/gravity-birds-grok-cursor/","example:dunkirk-ai-assisted","dunkirk-ai-assisted","Dunkirk: an honestly documented AI-assisted shooter","A WWII-inspired vertical arcade shooter with a public Godot project and a precise breakdown of AI and manual contributions.","/examples/dunkirk-ai-assisted/","example:garden-match-agents","garden-match-agents","Garden Match: agents build and review a puzzle game","A gentle match-3 game with cascading tiles, a companion pet, saved progress, and a garden that grows as levels are cleared.","/examples/garden-match-agents/","example:running-man-claude-pixellab","running-man-claude-pixellab","Running Man: Claude Code meets PixelLab","A one-button runner combining a scrolling pixel-art world, animated character states, obstacle patterns, and generated sound.","/examples/running-man-claude-pixellab/","example:bash-fighter-agent","bash-fighter-agent","Bash Fighter: an agent-developed multiplayer brawler","A browser platform fighter with online battles, bots, collapsing arenas, and a public client and match-server implementation.","/examples/bash-fighter-agent/","example:flux-codex-runner","flux-codex-runner","Flux: Codex gravity-flip runner","Flip between the floor and ceiling to avoid obstacles in a compact reflex game with synthesized audio and selectable themes.","/examples/flux-codex-runner/","example:claude-mini-snake","claude-mini-snake","Mini Snake: a Claude conversation game","Classic Snake with several food effects, particle feedback, local high scores, and touch input.","/examples/claude-mini-snake/","example:cursor-procedural-platformer","cursor-procedural-platformer","Cursor’s procedural platformer experiment","A side-scrolling browser game with generated levels, collectibles, character upgrades, and optional multiplayer.","/examples/cursor-procedural-platformer/","example:claude-tower-defense","claude-tower-defense","Claude Code Tower Defense","Survive enemy waves, buy upgrades, and carry permanent progression between runs in a complete tower-defense game.","/examples/claude-tower-defense/","example:pixel-princess-claude","pixel-princess-claude","Pixel Princess: a complete arcade campaign","Cross six themed worlds, defeat a boss, and reach a finale in a browser platformer with touch controls and offline play.","/examples/pixel-princess-claude/","example:gothicvania-codex","gothicvania-codex","GothicVania: Codex builds a platformer","A playable gothic platformer with enemies, combat, menus, music, and a detailed account of an iterative Codex workflow.","/examples/gothicvania-codex/","example:fragarena-copilot","fragarena-copilot","FragArena","A multiplayer space arena shooter with six-degree movement, bots, weapon pickups, radar, scoring, and respawning.","/examples/fragarena-copilot/","example:michi-neko-ai","michi-neko-ai","Michi-Neko · The Cat Philosopher’s Path","An early cat-exploration game in a Kyoto-inspired valley with NPC quests, weather, a tea house, and saved progression.","/examples/michi-neko-ai/","example:the-tithe-claude","the-tithe-claude","The Tithe","A first-person horror adventure through a flooded cult house, with weapons, keyed progression, checkpoints, and a final escape.","/examples/the-tithe-claude/","example:slide-rush-opus","slide-rush-opus","Slide Rush","A mobile-friendly waterslide race against twelve rivals, with jumps, shortcuts, practice mode, and procedural characters.","/examples/slide-rush-opus/","example:vibe-jet-gemini","vibe-jet-gemini","Vibe Jet","An arcade flying game with a documented Gemini 2.5 Pro prompting process and a Node/WebSocket multiplayer server.","/examples/vibe-jet-gemini/","example:dragons-reach-claude","dragons-reach-claude","Dragon’s Reach","A procedural dragon platformer with floating islands, gliding, flame combat, collectible eggs, and a final portal.","/examples/dragons-reach-claude/","example:ombres-claude","ombres-claude","Ombres","A 3D party game where giant birds paint territory with their shadows as the sun sets; phones can act as controllers.","/examples/ombres-claude/","example:operation-naptime-claude","operation-naptime-claude","Operation Naptime · Operación Siesta","A baby escapes a playpen and causes living-room chaos before being caught, with fully procedural visuals and physics.","/examples/operation-naptime-claude/","example:orb-shooter-ai","orb-shooter-ai","Orb Shooter","A small first-person shooter combining agent-written mechanics with included warehouse, weapon, and enemy models.","/examples/orb-shooter-ai/","example:nova-lancer-claude","nova-lancer-claude","NOVA LANCER","A rail shooter crossing ocean, canyon, and fortress environments before a mechanical sea-dragon boss.","/examples/nova-lancer-claude/","example:long-wind-claude","long-wind-claude","Long Wind","A Chinese-language wuxia action game with three chapters, parries, bosses, generated characters, and retargeted animation.","/examples/long-wind-claude/","example:turbo-kart-rally-claude","turbo-kart-rally-claude","Turbo Kart Rally","A procedural kart racer with drifting, item battles, seven opponents, and a documented five-agent build.","/examples/turbo-kart-rally-claude/","example:opengame-mandalorian-shooter","opengame-mandalorian-shooter","Star Wars: Mandalorian Protocol","Explore a generated top-down shooter through its original combat brief, playable build, and full project.","/examples/opengame-mandalorian-shooter/","example:opengame-arithmancy-card-battle","opengame-arithmancy-card-battle","Harry Potter: Arithmancy Academy","A generated educational card battle turns math and science questions into spell casting and combo decisions.","/examples/opengame-arithmancy-card-battle/","example:opengame-marvel-platformer","opengame-marvel-platformer","Marvel Avengers: Infinity Strike","Study a generated action platformer with hero selection, combat skills, and a multi-stage brief.","/examples/opengame-marvel-platformer/","example:opengame-tower-defense","opengame-tower-defense","Hajimi Defense: The Tuna Crisis","A cat-themed tower defense published with its original generation prompt, live browser build, and exact game project.","/examples/opengame-tower-defense/","example:raccoon-heist-claude","raccoon-heist-claude","Raccoon Heist","A Claude-built 3D backyard caper: collect loot, avoid flashlight patrols and a guard dog, then bank your haul before dawn.","/examples/raccoon-heist-claude/","example:tower-of-time-ai-build","tower-of-time-ai-build","Tower of Time: prompting a rewind mechanic","A finished tower-defense game with time reversal and an extensive author-published prompt log covering mechanics, debugging, and polish.","/examples/tower-of-time-ai-build/","example:claude-agent-team-tetris","claude-agent-team-tetris","Tetris built by an AI agent team","A complete browser game with a published account of how three Claude Code teammates divided the rules, rendering, and controls.","/examples/claude-agent-team-tetris/","example:tron-exonix-claude","tron-exonix-claude","TRON: EXONIX","A neon 3D territory-capture game built through Claude Code, Godot MCP, Blender MCP, and generated assets, with human design and playtest feedback.","/examples/tron-exonix-claude/","example:moonlight-mayhem-codex","moonlight-mayhem-codex","Moonlight & Mayhem","A 3D museum heist made with Codex: rescue two raccoon crewmates, evade security, stack the crew, and steal the Golden Sardine.","/examples/moonlight-mayhem-codex/","example:dinosaur-offline-gemini-cli","dinosaur-offline-gemini-cli","Dinosaur Game Offline: Gemini CLI-assisted runner","Jump a pixel dinosaur over cacti and avoid flying obstacles while the score and speed increase. This small browser game includes its complete JavaScript implementation, sprites, and sound effects.","/examples/dinosaur-offline-gemini-cli/","example:cloud-crush-gemini-cli","cloud-crush-gemini-cli","Cloud Crush: Gemini CLI builds a match-3 game","Match cloud-service icons on an eight-by-eight board, chase a timed high score, and create special Gemini gems. Google publishes the complete Go game alongside a detailed Gemini CLI codelab.","/examples/cloud-crush-gemini-cli/","example:roo-code-action","roo-code-action","Action with AI: a Roo Code experiment","A small SVG top-down action prototype with mouse-aimed shooting, enemies and telegraphed attacks, paired with a detailed account of prompt-driven implementation.","/examples/roo-code-action/","example:three-quake-claude-port","three-quake-claude-port","Three Quake: an AI-assisted Quake port","Play Quake’s shareware episode in a Three.js browser port, and study how an existing shooter’s rendering and runtime were adapted with AI assistance.","/examples/three-quake-claude-port/","example:crown-defender-codex","crown-defender-codex","Crown Defender TD 3D · Codex build","Control a hero under an isometric camera, defend a castle through thirty waves and choose upgrades to unlock a cosmetic crown.","/examples/crown-defender-codex/","example:arkanoid-neon-claude","arkanoid-neon-claude","Arkanoid Neon","Bounce the ball through eight neon brick layouts, collect power-ups and keep the rally alive as the stages accelerate. This complete browser game uses Canvas 2D and synthesized Web Audio.","/examples/arkanoid-neon-claude/","example:supermarket-simulator-cursor","supermarket-simulator-cursor","Supermarket Simulator","Manage a supermarket in first person: order goods, unpack deliveries, stock shelves and serve customers. The creator built this Unity experiment with Cursor and generated the 3D models with Hunyuan.","/examples/supermarket-simulator-cursor/","example:magic-carpet-wizard-astra","magic-carpet-wizard-astra","Magic Carpet Wizard · A Thousand Skies","Fly a carpet over a tiny spherical world, thread scoring rings, cast three spells and face roaming enemies and bosses. Local ghost races let two players take turns.","/examples/magic-carpet-wizard-astra/","example:sakura-crossing-qwen","sakura-crossing-qwen","3D Sakura Crossing: an exploration prototype","Explore a cel-shaded Japanese neighbourhood with a working railway crossing, residents, a lifting bridge, a drivable car, and a swimmable river.","/examples/sakura-crossing-qwen/","example:claude-dreaming-godot","claude-dreaming-godot","Claude Dreaming","Walk from a pixel-art attic into playable 3D paintings: a dream garden, space flight, small planets, and community-built rooms.","/examples/claude-dreaming-godot/","example:sprout-quest-claude","sprout-quest-claude","Sprout Quest","Explore a small world, fight real-time arena battles, gather materials, craft gear and rebuild a village. Sprout Quest is a mobile-first adventure with a 2D world and live-rendered 3D characters and items.","/examples/sprout-quest-claude/","example:mosswing-astra","mosswing-astra","Mosswing","Keep a small creature airborne with one-tap flaps, pass scrolling stone gaps and chase a higher score in a compact 3D browser game.","/examples/mosswing-astra/","example:astra-floor-ai","astra-floor-ai","Astra Floor","Fight six zombie waves and a final boss in a first-person industrial arena, managing ammunition, recoil, stamina and purchases between rounds.","/examples/astra-floor-ai/","example:isocoaster-cursor","isocoaster-cursor","IsoCoaster","Lay out a theme park with roller coasters, rides and guests. IsoCoaster is a separate playable game and route in the creator’s Cursor-assisted IsoCity repository.","/examples/isocoaster-cursor/","example:spirit-of-kiro","spirit-of-kiro","Spirit of Kiro","Find unusual items, combine or transform them on a workshop bench, and sell the results to an AI appraiser in an open-ended crafting game.","/examples/spirit-of-kiro/","example:rhythm-master-windsurf","rhythm-master-windsurf","Rhythm Master 3D","A four-lane music game with generated synth tracks, difficulty settings, combos and a special mode, implemented as a single browser HTML file.","/examples/rhythm-master-windsurf/","example:pokemon-tactics-claude","pokemon-tactics-claude","Pokemon Tactics","Move Pokemon across an isometric battlefield, use elevation and aim area attacks without hitting allies. This playable tactical fan game combines a TypeScript simulation with 2D-HD sprites on Babylon.js terrain.","/examples/pokemon-tactics-claude/","example:clowder-and-crest-agents","clowder-and-crest-agents","Clowder & Crest","Recruit cats into a medieval guild, take jobs across fifteen minigame types, develop bonds and follow a seven-chapter campaign shaped by the guild’s reputation.","/examples/clowder-and-crest-agents/","example:novel-journey-to-west","novel-journey-to-west","Journey to the West: Three Borrowings of the Banana Fan","A Chinese turn-based RPG with painted walking maps, quests, equipment, pets and command battles, adapted from the Banana Fan chapters of Journey to the West.","/examples/novel-journey-to-west/","example:vibe-racer-opencode","vibe-racer-opencode","Vibe Racer","A top-down time-trial racer with saved best laps, player and creator ghosts, mud surfaces, and a built-in track editor.","/examples/vibe-racer-opencode/","example:golden-hour-skatepark-cursor","golden-hour-skatepark-cursor","Golden Hour Skatepark","Skate an original beachside park: carve transitions, ollie, flip, grind, manual, bail and recover. This complete third-person sandbox has transient trick combos and a changeable time of day, with no levels or persistent score.","/examples/golden-hour-skatepark-cursor/","example:castle-clash-duel-claude","castle-clash-duel-claude","Castle Clash Duel","Recruit warriors and archers and fight a two-player tactical battle on a tilemap. This complete Phaser prototype pairs Claude Code implementation with Pixel Frog’s Tiny Swords artwork.","/examples/castle-clash-duel-claude/","example:silent-meridian-codex","silent-meridian-codex","Silent Meridian","Investigate an observatory trapped at 00:17, compare Present and Echo states, and solve thirteen connected puzzles across four chapters with a journal and optional hints.","/examples/silent-meridian-codex/","example:morbreaker-unity-claude","morbreaker-unity-claude","morBreaker","Clear ten brick-breaker levels with a paddle-controlled ball that accelerates on bounces, rising brick durability, and locally saved high scores.","/examples/morbreaker-unity-claude/","example:deep-yellow-claude","deep-yellow-claude","DEEP YELLOW","Explore procedural Backrooms in a first-person, turn-based roguelike. Moving or waiting triggers combat, while equipment combinations and sanity shape each run.","/examples/deep-yellow-claude/","example:surge-for-oinja-codex","surge-for-oinja-codex","SURGE for Oinja","Shape an electrical build while surviving mechanical swarms across two interactive maps. Automatic attacks leave movement, dodging, upgrades and facility restoration to the player.","/examples/surge-for-oinja-codex/","example:project-plateau","project-plateau","Project Plateau: Proof Before Dark","A first-person field-photography expedition inspired by The Lost World: frame prehistoric animals, manage four photographic plates, avoid threats and return to camp before daylight fades.","/examples/project-plateau/","example:isocity-cursor","isocity-cursor","IsoCity","Build an isometric city with zoning, roads, rail, utilities and a simulated population. IsoCity is a complete Canvas-based browser game that its creator attributes to Cursor.","/examples/isocity-cursor/","example:butch-graves-j2me","butch-graves-j2me","Butch Graves 3D","Fight through five Halloween shooter episodes with bosses, keys, secrets and scripted cutscenes, rendered by a compact raycasting engine for Java feature phones.","/examples/butch-graves-j2me/","example:pixel-orchard-astra","pixel-orchard-astra","Pixel Orchard · Memory Harvest","Turn over twelve seed packets to find six matching symbol pairs. Track moves, remember mismatches and reshuffle the garden for another short round.","/examples/pixel-orchard-astra/","example:fruit-ninja-dojo-astra","fruit-ninja-dojo-astra","Fruit Ninja Dojo · One More Slice","Swipe through airborne fruit, chain slices and dodge bombs in an unofficial Fruit Ninja recreation with Classic, sixty-second Arcade and ninety-second Zen modes.","/examples/fruit-ninja-dojo-astra/","example:thunderfall-astra","thunderfall-astra","THUNDERFALL · Skyward Expedition","Choose one of three fighters and weave through five sectors of drifting bullets, lasers and bosses. Collect four weapon colors and pick upgrades between stages.","/examples/thunderfall-astra/","example:nagi-home-cowork","nagi-home-cowork","Nagi Home","Care for Nagi, a small crab living in a procedural home: place food, throw a ball, request furniture activities and follow a diary as daily needs change. It is a quiet life simulation with saved progress.","/examples/nagi-home-cowork/","example:clockout-unseen-codex","clockout-unseen-codex","Clock Out Unseen","Sneak out of three offices before time expires, using furniture, coffee distractions and a temporary folder disguise to avoid patrol sightlines and reach an elevator.","/examples/clockout-unseen-codex/","example:fishslop-claude","fishslop-claude","Fishslop","Pilot a bathyscaphe through a sunken reef, feed fish, collect the coins they drop and buy new residents or submarine parts. Sonar briefly reveals an otherwise invisible Veilfin.","/examples/fishslop-claude/","example:pelican-bike-claude","pelican-bike-claude","Pelican on a Bike","Ride a helmeted pelican along a procedural coast, change lanes to catch fish, jump and unlock small achievements. The complete Three.js project includes its own character, bicycle, ocean, audio and day/night systems.","/examples/pelican-bike-claude/","example:three-kingdoms-codex","three-kingdoms-codex","Three Kingdoms: Hundred Heroes","Manage gold and grain, develop cities and command officers across fifteen strongholds. Choose Wei, Shu or Wu and compete with two computer factions to unify the map.","/examples/three-kingdoms-codex/","example:fang-fox-gbc-claude","fang-fox-gbc-claude","Fang the Fox · Game Boy Color","Explore floating islands, fight bosses, solve puzzles and follow a fox’s adventure as a real Game Boy Color game, playable through a browser emulator or a handheld ROM.","/examples/fang-fox-gbc-claude/","example:vibe-golf-bevy","vibe-golf-bevy","Vibe Golf","Charge and release shots across a hilly, prop-filled 3D landscape while chasing moving duck targets in a small arcade golf sandbox.","/examples/vibe-golf-bevy/","example:core-business-claude","core-business-claude","Core Business","Drill for minerals, manage fuel and hull condition, and spend earnings at surface shops in a non-commercial mining tech demo inspired by Motherload. Three.js renders the 2.5D world while Blender scripts produce its 3D assets.","/examples/core-business-claude/","example:eight-second-crew-codex","eight-second-crew-codex","8-Second Crew · 8초 도둑단","Record an eight-second route, replay it as a clone and cooperate with earlier selves to steal a key and escape. Nine stages introduce pressure plates, patrols and projectiles.","/examples/eight-second-crew-codex/","example:word-rain-chatgpt","word-rain-chatgpt","Word Rain","Move a basket to catch letters in the right order, complete shuffled words and survive red hazards. Shields, wildcards, perfect-word streaks and changing falling speed add decisions to the arcade spelling loop.","/examples/word-rain-chatgpt/","example:minimal-rogue-claude","minimal-rogue-claude","Minimal Rogue","Explore a monochrome dungeon, break blocks, manage stamina and equipment, and descend through an ASCII-style roguelike with English and Japanese interfaces.","/examples/minimal-rogue-claude/","example:polar-icecapade-claude","polar-icecapade-claude","Polar Icecapade","Slide across icy 3D arenas, use a three-hit melee combo to propel yourself forward, and fire projectiles that push you backward. Open gates and collect coins while confronting a rat regime in a short game-jam adventure.","/examples/polar-icecapade-claude/","example:overexposed-ai","overexposed-ai","Overexposed","Guide a rising performer through a year of career choices in a card-based fame simulation. Play cards to build craft, money and attention while three newspapers react and excessive heat turns into scandals.","/examples/overexposed-ai/","example:katana-kitsune-godot","katana-kitsune-godot","Katana Kitsune: Prototype","Choose a kitsune fighter and face yokai in an isometric action roguelike with katana combat, stamina, pickups and successive dungeon floors. The silent prototype supports local multiplayer, with additional party systems documented in the current source.","/examples/katana-kitsune-godot/","paper:paper-doi-10-1080-14786445008521796","paper-doi-10-1080-14786445008521796","Programming a computer for playing chess","Journal paper cited as reference [281] in AI for Games in the Foundation Model Era. The London, Edinburgh, and Dublin Philosophical Magazine and Journal of Science, 41(314):256–275, 1950.","https://doi.org/10.1080/14786445008521796","paper:paper-doi-10-1147-rd-33-0210","paper-doi-10-1147-rd-33-0210","Some studies in machine learning usi